&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new business opportunities to fuel Addepar’s growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and prioritize strategic target account lists and account attack plans within a defined territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and build new accounts (i.e. strategic calling, sending personalized emails, and connecting through social media platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct high level discovery conversations and meetings with prospect accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Go To Market teams (i.e. marketing, sales, and product, etc) to advance new business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
