&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of full-stack engineers, building a culture of accountability, quality, and continuous improvement from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management and design to define roadmaps, prioritize work, and deliver on initiatives that directly shape the advisor-client experience on Addepar&#39;s platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team&#39;s technical direction — guide architecture decisions, conduct design reviews, and stay close enough to the codebase to provide meaningful feedback in code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution across the team using well-defined goal-setting frameworks, balancing ambitious delivery targets with sustainable engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and hire engineers as the team grows, setting a high bar for both technical ability and collaborative fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across engineering teams to ensure the Advisor Experience products integrate cleanly with Addepar&#39;s broader platform — including the client portal, reporting infrastructure, and data layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion operational excellence — own the team&#39;s approach to testing, deployment, incident response, and technical debt management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
