&lt;li&gt;Manage, mentor, and recruit a team of full-stack software engineers, fostering a culture of technical excellence, continuous learning, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Design to define roadmaps, plan sprints, and ensure the successful, timely delivery of user and customer configuration tools built on Addepar’s identity platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the team&#39;s technical strategy as they migrate Addepar’s authentication experiences to new platforms, ensuring global availability and scalable user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align architectural, strategic identity investments with product-driven improvements, acting as a key stakeholder in technical design and architecture reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
