&lt;li&gt;Lead technical workstreams end-to-end, from requirements gathering through production deployment, owning outcomes and client success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Engineering, and Services teams to identify opportunities for productization and influence platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
