&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking a full stack software engineer to join the Alternatives Data Management (ADM) team. Our team is building AI-powered data products and workflow solutions that unlock transparency, efficiency, and insight in private market investments. You’ll join a full-stack team of engineers and collaborate closely with Product and Design to deliver client-facing features that will set us apart from our competitors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
