&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with our web platform and design system teams to ensure our product is a seamless part of the Addepar user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in the budding inner-source culture within Addepar, fostering standardization across the myriad of React, terraform and Python codebases within the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
