&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team has proper objectives, goals, and metrics to drive success by meeting Addepar’s expectations for productivity, quality, and goal accomplishment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive opportunities to improve our current processes and tools to better streamline, scale, and automate workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop employees using a performance management process that provides an overall context and framework to encourage employee contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide effective performance feedback through consistent 1:1s, semi-annual performance reviews, and career development planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan staffing levels and work with recruiting staff to recruit, interview, select, and hire an appropriate number of employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, mentor, and develop staff, including overseeing new employee onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegate responsibility and expect accountability and regular feedback from your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable data analytics processes for validation in Databricks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write custom Python logic to detect large-scale data anomalies and automate remediation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement AI-driven automation and LLM integrations to streamline implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership and Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal management and strategic initiatives to grow the Data Analytics practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amplify the mandate of the team and help execute on the team strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leads across regions to optimize team and process efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor the team. Drive prioritization, process, and execution consistency. Hone ability to drive results and manage team performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize and context-switch effectively to ensure the completion of simultaneous projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to, drive, and collaborate on best practices to ensure consistent and quality delivery of Data Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
