&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks and/or a cloud-based distributed data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-oriented approach and a passion for problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to research, design and implement solutions for complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
