&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in field marketing, event marketing, or a closely related B2B marketing discipline — with 2+ years managing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning a broad events portfolio: from large-scale flagship conferences to executive programs and regional activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence and align senior stakeholders across complex, cross-functional organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building &amp;amp; managing event budgets and reporting performance against pipeline and ROI metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fintech, wealth management, financial services, or enterprise SaaS strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SFDC, Marketo and On24 preferred&lt;/li&gt;
