&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end development of new AI features: help scope requirements, write specs, partner with engineering, design, and GTM to get them built and launched&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dig into how clients actually use our AI products today, surface what&#39;s working and what isn&#39;t, and turn those insights into clear, actionable product recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own well-defined pieces of the roadmap under the mentorship of senior PMs, with increasing autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get hands-on with the AI tools and techniques the team uses daily, including prompting, evaluating agent behavior, and understanding what makes an AI feature actually work in practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product analytics focused on usage patterns, adoption, feature performance&lt;/li&gt;
