&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build data-driven products for market data and our security master helping drive market data adoption, commercial growth by defining a clear strategy, profiling incoming vendor data and customer usage, validating use cases, and identifying growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on projects that provide an analytical foundation for the team, conducting data investigations, ad hoc queries, and structured analyses that inform prioritisation, requirements, and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain products including data pipelines, reporting, and self-serve dashboards that give the team and leadership visibility into dataset profitability, vendor licensing costs versus revenue, pipeline health, feed coverage, and commercial activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and improve repeatable tooling and workflows for vendor usage reporting, licensing reconciliation, and entitlement tracking, helping streamline Reference Data operations and support commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Productise monitoring for market data pipelines and operational dashboards, triaging feed errors and flagging issues to Operations and/or R&amp;amp;D with enough context to act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI-assisted tools to accelerate Reference Data product outcomes and analytical workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
