&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience as a product owner, data analyst, business analyst, or product analyst, ideally in financial services or a data-intensive SaaS environment where data quality and rigor matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills—you can write complex queries confidently and use them as a primary tool for investigation, not just reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted tools to accelerate analytical work and deliver outcomes tied to business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to build reporting across multiple data sources, bringing together information such as Salesforce, finance, and operational data to produce coherent, trustworthy views; experience with data pipelines, dashboards, or automation in Databricks or similar platforms is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
