&lt;p&gt;Addepar is hiring an Account Executive to lead our growth in Brazil, one of our priority expansion markets in LATAM. You’ll own new-business ARR across Registered Investment Advisors (RIAs), single and multi-family offices, and private banks, selling a platform that gives wealth and investment firms a unified view of complex portfolios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory plan covering your named accounts in Brazil, and selectively in neighboring LATAM markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run full-cycle enterprise sales, from prospecting and discovery through demo, negotiation, and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and convert opportunities with large financial institutions, partnering with Solutions Engineering and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with senior decision-makers at target firms, including CIOs, COOs, and founders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Addepar at client meetings and industry events in the region, with some travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
