&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B software sales, with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling SaaS into wealth management, asset management, banking, or the broader financial industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Portuguese and English (written and spoken); Spanish is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with Brazilian business culture and the local financial services landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience opening or expanding new markets or territories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading product demos and guiding buyers through complex, multi-stakeholder evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
