&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Transform:&lt;/strong&gt; You are responsible for designing the roadmap for Market Data operations. You will lead, train, and mentor a high-performing team, turning the function into a centre of excellence that balances technical integrity with commercial agility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively upskill the team in complex licensing frameworks and data observability, ensuring every team member is an expert in the &quot;Addepar way&quot; of data management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end accountability for the &quot;who, what, and how&quot; of data access, ensuring we stay ahead of audit requirements and vendor evolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and audit user access to market data (internal and external benchmark and market data) ensuring strict adherence to complex redistribution scenarios and vendor-specific restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Command:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the preparation and delivery of usage audits back to licensors, ensuring 100% compliance with all contractual clauses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Supervision:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee daily market data pipeline workflows to ensure the timely and accurate delivery of pricing and reference data feeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform internal verification checks to ensure data integrity (FX rates, corporate actions) and resolve exceptions to maintain high-quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a Rights Management framework to monitor data implementation and usage, ensuring all derived content follows vendor terms of use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI &amp;amp; Metrics:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and report on key performance indicators (KPIs) through automated dashboards to demonstrate operational health and team growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
