&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Product Manager to lead and shape Addepar’s Advisor experience for Registered Investment Advisors (RIAs). In this role, you will own the surface area, features, and capabilities designed specifically to empower wealth managers to acquire, retain, and advise their end-clients across web and mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
