&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of the Advisor persona within the RIA segment, learning how their daily workflows connect across the broader Addepar platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners and stakeholders to author a long-term product direction across mobile and web surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with AI and engineering teams to refine AI-powered insights,&amp;nbsp; ensuring they are tailored and contextually relevant for financial advisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate high-level business goals into clear, detailed requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria that empower engineering teams to deliver with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key adoption and engagement metrics to evaluate feature performance, refine workflows, and continuously elevate the Advisor experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the core purpose and value behind each product initiative, ensuring go-to-market teams are equipped to drive client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5 or more years of experience in Product Management. You have navigated the full lifecycle, from launching new applications and features from the ground up to scaling and optimizing established products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have practical experience incorporating AI/ML capabilities into workflow applications to deliver personalized user outcomes and streamline routine tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior experience in wealth management, fintech, or the RIA ecosystem, experience working with front-office wealth advisors is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in the cross-functional partnership across Product, Design, Engineering, and Client Success to solve complex problems and deliver intuitive user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance qualitative user insights with quantitative analytics to prioritize effectively, make sound decisions, and adapt your approach as new evidence emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at articulating the why behind every feature. You empower stakeholders and go-to-market partners with the narrative they need to effectively communicate value to our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
