&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of our CRM and Custodial Document workflows, learning how RIAs rely on Addepar’s integration ecosystem for their daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional engineering, design, and partnership teams to author a clear roadmap focused on Salesforce and key custodian partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate high-level business goals into well-defined product requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria that empower engineering teams to deliver features with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on scaling custodial document workflows and enabling self-service onboarding and ongoing integration management for Salesforce users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and explore opportunities to integrate AI-driven capabilities into data mapping, setup, and document workflows to simplify the user experience and reduce manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage comfortably with technical teams during discovery to review API specifications, data schemas, and webhooks to ensure integration viability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key platform health metrics, adoption rates, and client feedback to continuously refine integration performance and stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with internal client-facing teams and user feedback channels to identify user pain points and validate feature enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
