&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead frontend development for the Advisor Experience Secure Messaging product, building rich, performant user interfaces using modern web frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain scalable frontend architecture, including component libraries, state management patterns, and client-side data layer integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Design to translate wireframes and prototypes into polished, accessible interfaces that delight users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate frontend experiences with backend APIs and services, collaborating with backend engineers to define optimal API contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion frontend best practices including accessibility, performance optimization, responsive design, and automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
