&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addepar is a global data and AI platform empowering investment professionals to turn complex financial information into actionable intelligence. Addepar unifies portfolio, market and client data in a total portfolio view and delivers AI-powered insights within investment and client workflows. More than 1,500 firms in 60 countries use Addepar to manage and advise on nearly $10 trillion in assets. Its open platform integrates with 650 software, data and consulting partners to power end-to-end investment operations across firms of all sizes and levels of complexity. Addepar supports clients worldwide with offices in New York City, Salt Lake City, São Paulo, London, Edinburgh, Geneva, Warsaw, Dubai, Pune and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 data-local-id=&quot;ba6d0731b592&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;7e2eb28fee0f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly proactive &lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the architecture of our next-generation validation guardrails and spearhead our AI-native developer experience across the organization. This role focuses on architecting engineering workflows across all traditional SDLC stages - Planning, Design, Build, Test, Deploy, and Maintain - into automated, closed-loop system where AI agents and committed markdown artifacts are able to accelerate delivery while keeping human engineers and product managers firmly in control of high-judgement decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;23a3cf9466a7&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a technical thought leader, you will help lead the design of intelligent frameworks, AI SDLC playbooks, and deterministic guardrails required to modernize our SDLC. Operating with a high degree of autonomy, you will lead grassroots efforts across engineering teams, navigate technical ambiguitity to advocate for best practices, mentor devleopers and engineer the friction-free internal platform for the future.&lt;/p&gt;
