&lt;h4 data-local-id=&quot;dffb5f16b7e7&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-local-id=&quot;3e1e6f5aae96&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Grassroots Evangelism&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;dad25aec2a27&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Mentorship: Drive bottom-up adoption of AI-native development workflows across product teams by coaching engineers to transition into orchestration of parallel agentic sessions and subagents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;dad25aec2a27&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cross-Team Alignment: Partner with platform engineers, R&amp;amp;D teams, and security to dismantle traditional handoffs and convert manual sign-off cycles into automated artifact triggers with clear governance boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-local-id=&quot;a343efc0f68a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI-Native Lifecycle Architecture&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
