&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ea7b3ed449be&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deterministic Guardrails &amp;amp; Hooks: Architect deterministic build-time and deployment hooks to serve as safety boundaries behind AI development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;8cd5989e4aae&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Automated Code Review &amp;amp; PR pipelines: Integrate AI into PR review loop using structured policies and CI runners to enable agents to conduct multi-pass reviews and autonomously resolve comment threads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-local-id=&quot;9a473e25ef7a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Continuous Evals, Testing &amp;amp; Closed-Loop Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
