&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply technical and industry expertise to design and implement scalable, best-practice solutions within existing Addepar environments—delivering with speed, precision, and an unwavering commitment to quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact outcomes aligned to client goals, ensuring measurable value and satisfaction at every engagement milestone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor and subject matter expert across all aspects of the Addepar platform, bringing a consultative approach that clients rely on for their most complex challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and resolve technical risks before they escalate, demonstrating the urgency and ownership mindset that defines the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive proactive, transparent communication with stakeholders across internal and external teams—setting expectations clearly and following through relentlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate project health, risks, and milestones to senior stakeholders with clarity and confidence, escalating decisively when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong client relationships grounded in trust, consistent delivery, and a genuine commitment to their success—driving retention and referenceability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Account Executives, Client Success Managers, and Support Leads to build sustainable, business-as-usual (BAU) success models for long-term client success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and R&amp;amp;D teams to surface client insights that inform scalable tooling, reduce client dependence on premium services, and accelerate self-sufficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a cross-functional warrior—bridging gaps between teams, breaking down silos, and ensuring the right people are connected to solve problems quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to optimize internal processes, tools, and engagement models as the client base scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable methodologies, pre-configured templates, and process improvements to reduce project complexity and compress timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a technical inclination toward building tools, scripts, and automations that eliminate manual work and increase throughput—never satisfied with “good enough” when a better system can be built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
