&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in Project Management, Financial Services, Professional Services, or Consulting; prior client-facing and financial services experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, organizational, and time-management skills—you operate with urgency and hold yourself to the highest standard of follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of historical data conversion methodologies and source systems, or related experience in professional services, client implementations, solution consulting, wealthtech, or prior Addepar platform exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Characteristics That Define You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless sense of urgency: You don’t wait for permission to act. When something needs to happen, you make it happen—today, not next week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous attention to detail: You catch what others miss. Your work is precise, polished, and ready for scrutiny at every level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional warrior: You thrive at the intersection of teams. You build relationships, break down barriers, and drive alignment across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Never satisfied, always learning: You ask “what’s next?” before the current project is even finished. You seek feedback, absorb new skills, and constantly raise your own bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical builder at heart: You have a natural inclination toward tools, automation, and scripting. You see repetitive work as a problem to be engineered away, not accepted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent and adaptable: You thrive in fast-paced, ambiguous environments and take ownership without being told&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
